      "content": "the thing is i already tried contacting the support team but they responded with a generic template saying they have no record of an account under my name or email. it's like they're gaslighting me. if it was just a normal moderator or a mistake, there would be some kind of log or a paper trail, but everything is just... blank. like they're scrubbing the very evidence that i ever existed on these platforms. it feels way too coordinated to be just some random forum mod. does that even make sense? that someone could be using a level of access that bypasses standard audit logs?",
